WEBVTT

00:00:10.028 --> 00:00:11.595
Mr. Filch?

00:00:11.638 --> 00:00:13.205
Round up the ghosts.

00:00:13.248 --> 00:00:15.642
Tell them to search
every painting in the castle

00:00:15.686 --> 00:00:17.035
to find the Fat Lady.

00:00:17.078 --> 00:00:20.038
There's no need
for ghosts, Professor.

00:00:20.081 --> 00:00:21.561
[ baby crying]

00:00:21.605 --> 00:00:23.128
The Fat Lady is there.

00:00:23.171 --> 00:00:24.608
[ students gasping]

00:00:24.651 --> 00:00:26.871
PERCY:
Hey! Mind where
you're going!

00:00:26.914 --> 00:00:28.002
Slow down!

00:00:28.046 --> 00:00:29.351
You listen!
I'm Head Boy!

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:30.614
[ growling]Come back here!

00:00:30.657 --> 00:00:32.224
DUMBLEDORE:
Keep moving!

00:00:32.267 --> 00:00:34.443
FILCH:
Make way. Make way!
Go, go, go!

00:00:34.487 --> 00:00:36.445
[ students murmuring]

00:00:36.489 --> 00:00:37.664
Dear Lady...

00:00:37.708 --> 00:00:39.013
who did this to you?

00:00:39.057 --> 00:00:41.015
[ sobbing]

00:00:41.059 --> 00:00:43.540
Eyes like the devil, he's got.

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:46.194
And a soul as dark as his name.

00:00:46.238 --> 00:00:47.805
It's him, Headmaster.

00:00:47.848 --> 00:00:50.024
The one they all talk about.

00:00:50.068 --> 00:00:51.939
He's here,
somewhere in the castle!

00:00:51.983 --> 00:00:52.940
Sirius Black!

00:00:52.984 --> 00:00:54.028
[ whimpering sobs]

00:00:54.072 --> 00:00:55.290
STUDENTS:
Sirius Black?!

00:00:55.334 --> 00:00:57.162
Secure the castle,
Mister Filch.

00:00:57.205 --> 00:00:58.119
The rest of you,

00:00:58.163 --> 00:00:59.164
to the Great Hall.

00:00:59.207 --> 00:01:00.644
PERCY:
Now don't stop.

00:01:00.687 --> 00:01:01.775
Just keep going.

00:01:01.819 --> 00:01:06.301
[ rattling and clicking]

00:01:15.789 --> 00:01:19.576
♪

00:01:28.149 --> 00:01:29.368
FILCH:
I've searched

00:01:29.411 --> 00:01:30.848
the Astronomy Tower
and the Owlery, sir.

00:01:30.891 --> 00:01:31.979
But there's
nothing there.

00:01:32.023 --> 00:01:33.328
DUMBLEDORE:
Ah, thank you.

00:01:33.372 --> 00:01:34.460
TEACHER:
Yes.

00:01:34.503 --> 00:01:35.853
The third floor's
clear, too, sir.

00:01:35.896 --> 00:01:36.854
Very good.

00:01:36.897 --> 00:01:37.985
SNAPE:
And I've done

00:01:38.029 --> 00:01:38.943
the dungeons,
Headmaster.

00:01:38.986 --> 00:01:40.205
No sign of Black,

00:01:40.248 --> 00:01:41.554
nor anywhere else
in the castle.

00:01:41.598 --> 00:01:44.296
I didn't really expect him
to linger.

00:01:44.339 --> 00:01:45.950
SNAPE:
Remarkable feat,

00:01:45.993 --> 00:01:47.168
don't you think?

00:01:47.212 --> 00:01:49.301
To enter Hogwarts Castle
on one's own,

00:01:49.344 --> 00:01:50.868
completely undetected.

00:01:50.911 --> 00:01:52.391
Quite remarkable, yes.

00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:55.002
Any theories on how he
might have managed it?

00:01:55.046 --> 00:01:57.048
Many. Each as unlikely
as the next.

00:01:57.091 --> 00:02:00.312
You may recall,
prior to the start of term,

00:02:00.355 --> 00:02:01.792
I did express concerns

00:02:01.835 --> 00:02:04.316
about your appointment
of Professor Lupin...

00:02:04.359 --> 00:02:06.666
Not a single professor
inside this castle

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:08.537
would help Sirius Black
to enter it.

00:02:08.581 --> 00:02:11.366
No, I'm quite convinced
the castle is safe.

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:12.803
And I'm more than willing

00:02:12.846 --> 00:02:14.979
to send the students
back to their houses.

00:02:15.022 --> 00:02:17.634
What about Potter?
Should he be warned?

00:02:17.677 --> 00:02:18.722
Perhaps.

00:02:18.765 --> 00:02:20.375
But for now,
let him sleep.

00:02:20.419 --> 00:02:25.859
For in dreams, we enter a world
that's entirely our own.

00:02:25.903 --> 00:02:29.341
Let him swim
in the deepest ocean.

00:02:29.384 --> 00:02:33.954
Or glide over the highest cloud.

00:02:40.004 --> 00:02:43.747
♪

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.845
[ rustling]

00:02:57.761 --> 00:03:00.938
[ children talking]

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:04.898
[ shutters slamming]

00:03:10.295 --> 00:03:14.560
Turn to page 394.

